# 3D coordinates, in meters, of the points to click to initialize the tracking of the castle, shown on castle.jpg.
# They are corners of castle_parts/castle_floor.cao and castle_parts/castle_tower.cao.
4                                  # Number of points
-0.14987   0.08076   0.02945       # Point 1: front corner of the floor, far from the tower (floor point 00)
-0.03944   0.08076   0.03900       # Point 2: bottom front corner of the left face of the tower (tower point 01)
-0.03944   0.17876   0.03900       # Point 3: top front corner of the left face of the tower (tower point 00)
-0.04300   0.17876  -0.04300       # Point 4: top back corner of the left face of the tower (tower point 05)
